  The tamil_headline and reel_script say 'பரமத்தி வேலூர்' (Paramathi Velur) as the place of the lottery sale, but the article says the complaint came from P. Velur (ப.வேலூர்) and the arrests happened in Pothanur; the headline's place wording is not supported as the location of the crime.
  The slides_spec 'போலீஸ் நடவடிக்கை' slide says 'பரமத்தி வேலூர் போலீசார் வழக்குப் பதிவு செய்தனர்' (police registered a case); the article does not mention a case being registered, only arrests and seizure of lottery tickets.
